{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"makefile","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Makefile","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Makefile (.mk .mak).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"makefile","name":"Makefile","extensions":[".mk",".mak"],"grammar":"grammars/makefile.json","filenames":["Makefile","makefile","GNUmakefile"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Makefile","path":"snippets/makefile.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/makefile.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^[A-Za-z0-9_./%-]+(?=\\\\s*:(?!=))\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[({][^)}]+[)}]|\\\\$[@<^?*]\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*[:+?]?=)\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:sinclude|override|unexport|include|ifndef|export|define|ifneq|ifdef|endif|endef|vpath|ifeq|else)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:\\\\.PRECIOUS|\\\\.SUFFIXES|\\\\.DEFAULT|\\\\.PHONY)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/makefile.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Target\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tgt\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:target}: ${2:deps}\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A target\"\n  },\n  \"Phony\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"phony\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \".PHONY: ${1:all clean}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \".PHONY\"\n  },\n  \"Variable\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"var\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:CC} := ${2:gcc}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A variable\"\n  },\n  \"Clean\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"clean\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"clean:\",\n      \"\\t$(RM) -r ${1:build}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A clean target\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Makefile\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Makefile.\n\n## Files\n\n`.mk`, `.mak`, `Makefile`, `makefile`, `GNUmakefile`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `tgt` | A target |\n| `phony` | .PHONY |\n| `var` | A variable |\n| `clean` | A clean target |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}